	quest.0C1009226D2AD3F8.quest_desc: [
		"You have a 3% chance of gaining a curse when reaching the EP needed for a Engraving"
		"if the engraving is applied by Godly Craftsman or any other skill then youl have a 3% chance per excisting engraving"
		"Holy armanents boots,chest and leggings cant get cursed"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&4&lCurse of Enervation&r&r"
		"Drains Saturation from nearby beings"
		""
		"When on an weapon/tool, every non-undead entity(including the user) will lose 2 saturation each second per level."
		""
		"Level 1 = 2 saturation"
		"Level 2 = 4 saturation"
		"Level 3 = 6 saturation"
		"When on armor, every non-undead entity(including the user) will lose 5 saturation each second per armor piece, per level."
		""
		"Level 1 = 5, 10, 15, or 20 saturation total per 1, 2, 3, 4 armor pieces"
		"Level 2 = 10, 20, 30, or 40 saturation total per 1, 2, 3, 4 armor pieces"
		"Level 3 = 15, 30, 45 or 60 saturation total per 1, 2, 3, 4 armor pieces"
		"The user of items with Curse of Enervation will have a flat decrease of damage taken of 10 per piece, per level."
		""
		"Level 1 = 10, 20, 30, or 40 damage reduction per 1, 2, 3, 4 armor pieces"
		"Level 2 = 20, 40, 60, or 80 damage reduction per 1, 2, 3, 4 armor pieces"
		"Level 3 = 30, 60, 90, or 120 damage reduction per 1, 2, 3, 4 armor pieces"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&4&lCurse of Lethargy&r&r"
		"Slows your ep gain"
		""
		"Items with this curse will have a 20% decrease in ep gain, as well as decreasing the users ep gain by 20%"
		""
		"&4&lCurse of Sealing&r&r"
		"Items with this curse will be unable to gain any other engravings or enchantments."
		""
		"Enchants and engravings on affected items will be unable to be taken by Researcher, Godly Craftsman or Degenerate"
		""
		"Items also cannot be decrafted or grindstoned while this curse is applied."
		""
		"Curse of Stagnation"
		"No breakthrough for you"
		""
		"Items with this curse will be unable to evolve to the next material"
		""
		"For example, High Magisteel Axe won't be able to evolve into Pure Magisteel Axe"
		""
		"&4&lCurse of Ruination&r&r"
		"No durability regen"
		""
		"Items with this curse will no longer be able to regenerate durability through EP."
		""
		"XP gained by killing mobs will be instantly consumed"
	]
