	quest.0F5CA1DE20FBE8C3.quest_desc: ["Hang Glider adds a hang glider (surprise!) to soar through the skies! Just jump off a cliff and let your glider do the rest. Features very fluid and natural flight controls and nice models. And when you wanna go even quicker reinforce your glider!"]
