	quest.25FEF5A5DE0D3583.title: "Copper Fashion"
	quest.261840F62D1C1418.quest_desc: ["Sapphire tools have higher attack dammade and they deal +3% of enemy's maximum health"]
	quest.2621298771394DB4.title: "A place to sleep"
	quest.26447421BEC27859.quest_desc: ["Make a Vampire Village with the totem top and the totem base"]
	quest.26447421BEC27859.title: "Reach Vampire level 14"
	quest.2645D3C635C064E3.quest_subtitle: "Remove your curse"
	quest.2831FA67C629B4A3.title: "Removeing enchants"
	quest.28AC20D4F4C9A287.quest_desc: ["Get the darkness effect while having a decaying relic in your inventory to get the Magispear"]
	quest.294BBA5AC6EF32D5.quest_desc: [
		"The tools needed to progress."
		""
		"The table acts as a more powerful enchanting table and is used as the crafting table for the mod"
	]
	quest.294BBA5AC6EF32D5.title: "First steps"
	quest.2A0A01BE836BB2AB.quest_desc: ["A monument of grandeur and mystery, the Shiraz Palace sprawls in every direction, its halls twisting and turning beyond comprehension. Its purpose remains unknown, but its size and opulence are undeniable. Travelers beware: without a companion, it’s all too easy to lose your way in this labyrinthine estate."]
	quest.2A0A01BE836BB2AB.quest_subtitle: "Find the Shiraz Palace"
	quest.2A1B0386B7987DD3.quest_desc: ["Vast and dreamlike, the Aviary stretches high into wtilight sky, its halls divided into four whimsical quadrants. Each one unfolds as a surreal scene—bright, strange, and perilous in its own way. To wander here feels like stepping beyond reality itself. Is this the journey’s end… or just another beginning?"]
	quest.2A1B0386B7987DD3.quest_subtitle: "Find an Aviary"
	quest.2A3BCF09349D2904.quest_subtitle: "Fly like an Angel"
	quest.2A41A270337B08E2.quest_desc: ["The End is a space-like dimension with floating end stone islands, accessible with an end portal. It is typically considered the opposite of the Nether. The End is a barren environment, but it is the only place where some of the most unique and useful items in the game can be obtained, such as the elytra or shulker boxes."]
	quest.2A478FC80AA05DB9.quest_desc: ["TV Remote Replacement"]
	quest.2A478FC80AA05DB9.title: "TV Remote"
	quest.2A7E097C3495D539.quest_subtitle: "Wither skull pain no more"
	quest.2AAF6DD5BA72F9F8.quest_desc: ["+2 armor"]
	quest.2B2B113A16A83C87.quest_desc: ["Kill The Frenzied Shade"]
	quest.2B3EA95F82C910AA.title: "Steel Fashion"
	quest.2B5884D4A5692121.quest_desc: ["Smelt the chunk into a usable ingot"]
	quest.2B70445E6CD99EDB.quest_desc: [
		"Strange structures have begun rising from the land. Mysterious dungeons, fortresses, and towers that pierce the skies. No one knows where they came from, only that they’re teeming with hostile creatures, forgotten treasures, and powerful secrets."
		""
		"Your task is to venture forth and uncover the mysteries of these ancient places. Each dungeon holds new dangers, but also the keys to survival: weapons, artifacts, and knowledge that will aid you in the trials ahead."
		""
		"Prepare yourself adventurer. &6Exploration&r and courage are the only ways to thrive in this world where the land itself rises against you."
	]
	quest.2BF086D27EA9B736.quest_desc: [
		"Use the &aV&r key to open scanner"
		"Use the &6O&r key to scan"
		""
		"(If you still dont have Great Sage, use the quest on the left of this to unlock it manually)"
	]
	quest.2BF086D27EA9B736.title: "Great Sage Unlocked"
	quest.2C4568B746EBCC62.quest_desc: ["heal with gem of promise in of hand"]
	quest.2C5EA5D93CDC7875.quest_desc: [
		"These can be empowered with enchants only obtainable with the imbuding table"
		""
		"They can give effects like showing mobs/ores around you, giveing buffs when day or night, and more"
	]
	quest.2C5EA5D93CDC7875.title: "Imbued Fashion"
	quest.2C75494E30257EE1.quest_desc: [
		"Generates in The End between Y=0 and Y=32 (mostly Y=16)"
		""
		"used to craft Mythic ingots"
	]
	quest.2C7C7E42866DBF29.title: "Onionionion!"
	quest.2DA69E8575FA7288.quest_desc: [
		"Fidn the Charybdis Core in its cave, kill entitys withing 16blocks to fill it with EP (Note killign mobs next to a care will prevent the played getting any EP from the kills)"
		""
		"when the core is full right click the core to summon Charybdis"
		""
		"&4WARNING: Charybdis has high regeneration and high HP, if you cant deal enough dammage or have a way to prevent healing YOU WONT KILL IT. Spawning in Hell will cause it to regen its MP at a higher rate making it near imortal unless you can dammage them quickly and hard&r"
	]
	quest.2DB4F395EA26DF4B.quest_subtitle: "Find a Coliseum"
	quest.2DB72C0DE805C6DC.title: "Withered Deamon Heart"
	quest.2DCE7611A995B73D.quest_desc: ["Guide for Occultism"]
	quest.2DCE7611A995B73D.title: "Occultism"
	quest.2DE7FF157A99178A.quest_desc: [
		"Provides Poisonus Thorns"
		""
		"Poisonous Thorns applies thorns and poison to enemy for 5 seconds"
	]
	quest.2E4CCFE615C88D0A.quest_desc: ["Mines in a 3x2 area"]
	quest.2EFC5DBD8122A0AE.quest_desc: ["Far below the surface lies a twisted network of chambers, where the air is thick with disease and shadow. Once a place of treatment, it now resembles a burial ground for forgotten rulers, its halls echoing with the whispers of those long lost. Only the brave (or the desperate) dare to tread these haunted corridors."]
	quest.2EFC5DBD8122A0AE.quest_subtitle: "Find a Plague Asylum"
	quest.2F44D5340015AF2E.quest_desc: [
		"The most basic type can be found in the wild and can be tamed by using \"Gysahl Greens\" on them. Gysahl Greens is a plant found in the wild, but also can be planted by sowing Gysahl Seeds. Gysahl Seeds can be received by crafting from Gysahl Greens or by harvesting planted Gysahl Greens."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Chocobos can be breed and procreate. The offspring will be a Chicobo, the juvenile form of a Chocobo. After a while a Chicobo will grow into a Chocobo. Chicobos will be born wild and have to be tamed. Chicobos will inherit the type from one of their parents or mutate into new types. Thus by repeatedly breeding Chocobos all normal types of Chocobos can be acquired from tamed wild Chocobos. There are a few special Chocobo types though, which can only be acquired by special means."
	]
	quest.2F4F7951D441F537.quest_subtitle: "Raw Etheruim is found in end city chests"
	quest.2FA9BE6460EBD9F5.quest_desc: [
		"&2Transport mobs with lassos. But be quick! Mobs will escape after some time!&r"
		"The &6golden lasso&r can capture all land animals."
		"The &baquatic lasso&r can capture all water animals."
		"The &9diamond lasso&r can capture all animals and does not have a timer."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The &aemerald lasso&r can only capture villagers, but not every villager wants to be captured! Make sure they accept a contract first, but not every villager will do."
		"A &4hostile lasso&r can capture hostile mobs, but there is a catch! Any capture monster must be below 50% health and will continuously bite you while carrying the lasso. Be careful!"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Rename the captured mob by applying a new name to the lasso in an anvil."
		"Enchanting a lasso with the holding enchantment for the duration to last longer."
	]
	quest.2FA9BE6460EBD9F5.quest_subtitle: "Catch em all!"
	quest.2FA9BE6460EBD9F5.title: "Mob Lassos"
	quest.2FB267EEE5A01C5C.quest_desc: [
		"Craft it using an Undead Soul"
