	quest.36F76893CA3F9E17.title: "Complete"
	quest.36FCC9F01646B8F9.quest_subtitle: "Part of the Eternal Life set"
	quest.376314CA92EDE736.quest_subtitle: "Repeatable"
	quest.376314CA92EDE736.title: "Arcane Crystal Dust Speck"
	quest.3828ECF3777FFAE2.quest_desc: [
		"Standard Vanilla blocks only drop 1 specific item when mined or broken. You now have a chance to receive some rare items when mining."
		""
		"Looking for some food? go searching in some dirt or netherrack"
		"Looking for Diamonds or Emeralds? go mine some ores and even get double your standard rewards!"
		"Looking for even more rare items? go mine some End Blocks"
		""
		"Drops are based on weightage system. You are guaranteed the standard vanilla drops and have a chance to get the other items."
	]
	quest.383970C79F43B2F1.quest_subtitle: "Repeatable"
	quest.383970C79F43B2F1.title: "Darkstone"
	quest.385B7DC4812520F4.quest_desc: ["acts like a redstone block when placed down"]
	quest.38C3EB3E5FA015AB.quest_desc: [
		"EP (short for Evolution Points) is a rough indicator of how strong a Mob, Player, or Item is. Both you and certain items — such as Monster Leather and Magic Steel gear — can evolve once they accumulate enough EP"
		""
		""
		"&2&n&lGaining EP&r&r&r"
		"The primary way to gain EP is by killing mobs. The stronger the mob, the more EP you receive. Without any special skills (such as Gourmand), you gain 3% of the mob's EP per kill."
		""
		"However, the EP gained is reduced if the mob is significantly weaker than you. The larger the EP gap in your favor, the smaller the reward down to a maximum reduction of -90% of the mob's EP."
		""
		"&4&n&lDeath Penalty&r&r&r"
		"Dying causes you to lose 5% of your current EP, along with a reduction to your Magicule and Aura."
		""
		"&2&n&lEP and Stat Growth&r&r&r"
		"Gaining EP also increases your Max Magicule and Max Aura. The split depends on your race:"
		""
		"Majin: 2/3 Magicule, 1/3 Aura"
		"Non-Majin: 2/3 Aura, 1/3 Magicule"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&b&n&lMagicule&r&r&r"
		"Your Magicule Regeneration rate is fixed by default, but it can be increased through the following means:"
		""
		"Equipping armor with the Magicule Absorption engraving"
		"Being in certain Dimensions or Biomes"
		""
		"&5&l&nBoosted Dimentions:&r&r&r"
		"- &4Hell&r"
		"- &6Labyrinth&r"
		""
		"&5&l&nBoosted Biomes:&r&r&r"
		"- Barren Lands"
		"- Ancient Forrest"
	]
	quest.38C3EB3E5FA015AB.title: "EP and Magicule"
	quest.38C8CE03B0DE2BF2.title: "Unbound Tome"
	quest.3911131A57D70D4E.quest_desc: [
		"This skill will make you reset from the begining, and remove all your skills upon death"
		""
		"The upside is abilities that may aid your next life, the ability to save skills from your privious life"
		""
		"&4&lyou only get ONE chance at gaining this skill, YOU WILL NOT BEABLE TO GAIN IT AGAIN&r"
	]
	quest.3911131A57D70D4E.quest_subtitle: "willing to risk everything?"
	quest.3912B4FC2E2FA7CB.quest_desc: [
