	quest.4419BC0D2C2EAD3B.quest_desc: [
		"&z&l&nTrue Demon Lord&r&r&r"
		""
		"&5&l&nObtainment:&r&r&r"
		""
		"&l&nSeed&r&r"
		"To Awaken, you need a Demon Lord Seed which is gained by having 200k EP and being a Majin."
		""
		"&l&nSouls&r&r"
		"Once you have the seed, you are able to gain souls. To gain souls, kill any Mob with EP, 2k EP is equivalent to 1 soul"
		""
		"&l&nAwakening&r&r"
		"For the awakening you need 10,000 Souls, you can choose to awaken whenever you want but once your soul amount reaches 20,000 you will be forced into awakening"
		""
		"A new Button will appear inside your Status Menu. Once clicked, it will announce in the chat that you have awoken as a True Demon Lord"
		""
		"&n&lHarvest Festival&r&r"
		"A player evolving to True Demon Lord will go through a Harvest Festival upon activation, which will last 3 minutes and affect subordinates in a 30 block radius."
		""
		"Within the first minute, the player will be unable to use any abilities and have limited vision/movement, all mob subordinates within range will be automatically set to Follow and Protect."
		""
		"Reaching the second minute, the player will be sent into Sleep Mode instantly, unable to move or use any ability."
		""
		"In the last minute, players subordinate and mobs subordinates (if within range) will be also automatically sent into Sleep Mode."
		""
		"Dying during Harvest Festival will lead to the loss of all acquired souls"
		""
		"&5&n&lEffects:&r&r&r"
		"- Grants an 3x EP buff"
		""
		"- Double stats for subordinates (has to be npc subordinates, will not work on player)"
		""
		"- An Evolution to player races and eligible NPCs"
		""
		"- Evolution of all applicable/current Resistances to Nullifications"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&z&n&lTrue Hero&r&r&r"
		""
		"&6&n&lObtainment:&r&r&r"
		""
		"&n&lBlessed&r&r"
		"There is a 5% Chance on Reincarnation/Reset as a non-majin race to be Blessed. This grants you all Elemental Spirits Plus Either Light or Dark when you pray, granting you the Hero Egg Instantly."
		""
		"&l&nEgg&r&r"
		"Acquire all 5 base element Greater Spirits (Fire, Water, Wind, Earth, Space) + a Greater Light or Greater Darkness spirit to Gain the Hero Egg - Note - You must not be a Default Majin race"
		""
		"It will announce to you that you have obtained the Hero Egg."
		""
		"&n&lEgg - Ability&r&r"
		"You will also gain Eye Of Truth"
		""
		"&n&lHatching&r&r"
		"To Hatch said Egg and become a True Hero, you will need to regenerate HP while under 25% of your max HP while fighting a boss which meets all the requirements below."
		""
		"-The boss must have at least 400k EP."
		""
		"-The boss must be below 50% HP."
		""
		"-The mob must be tagged as a valid boss for True Hero awakening. A list is provided below."
		""
		"-Bosses that count towards True Hero Awakening"
		""
		"&6&n&lEffects&r&r&r"
		""
		"-Grants a 3x Ep buff"
		""
		"-Evolution of all Resistances to Nullifications"
		""
		"-Grants Unpredictability. When toggled, while attacking or being attacked, ignores every Dodge, Crit Chance, and Dodge Avoidance abilities. Cannot be used without being a True Hero."
	]
	quest.4419BC0D2C2EAD3B.title: "Awakening"
	quest.4429921F7893A98A.quest_desc: [
		"Craft it using aquatic items"
		""
		"Those who followed this eye were never seen again; rumors say they found the great city of Atlantis, or lost their way trying"
	]
	quest.4439AA65A8C639AE.quest_desc: [
		"Totemic is all about Totem Poles, nature and the power of music."
		""
		"It's focus lies on Totem Poles. They can give passive boons to players nearby, but more importantly, they are the central piece of Ceremonies: Dancing around a Totem Pole and playing various musical instruments to invoke strong effects and manipulate the world."
	]
	quest.44B66C501013E9BD.quest_desc: ["Kill 20 vampire barons and get pure blood which is needed to level up"]
	quest.44D115281B0BFB75.quest_desc: ["Whispers speak of a &9flying vessel&r that hovers above the world, shimmering with strange energy. Few dare approach, for those who return tell of eerie lights, warped corridors, and guardians not of this realm. Seek it out, if you dare—and uncover the secrets hidden within its metallic shell."]
