	quest.52EF8FFBD86F97A9.quest_desc: [
		"gained by mastering Reversers Inverted fusion subskill"
		"costs 10k MP per curse revirsed"
		""
		"&6&lBlessing of Vitality&r&r"
		"Reverse Curse of Enervation"
		""
		"Regenerates Saturation if non-undead."
		""
		"Applies the same damage reduction as Curse of Enervation"
		""
		"Damage reduction will not stack with Curse of Enervation"
		""
		"&6&lBlessing of Vigor&r&r"
		"Reverse Curse of Lethargy"
		""
		"Items with this blessing will have a 20% buff to ep gain rate, and will also buff the users ep gain by 20%"
		""
		"&6&lBlessing of Transcendence&r&r"
		"Reverse Curse of Sealing"
		""
		"Allows the item to gain a random engraving at 1.5 million EP"
		""
