	quest.5EF80BF205A9D291.quest_desc: [
		"&n&l&eHoly&r&r&r"
		"A term for non-majin life forms that have achieved Saint level"
		""
		"You can NOT become holy if you have become a &5Majin&r"
		""
		"&2&n&lObtaining&r&r&r"
		"reach your third evolution on a race thast not a &5Majin&r by defult"
		""
		"Human Saint"
		"Elf Saint"
		"Dwarf Saint"
		"Merfolk Saint"
		"Hobgoblin Saint"
		"Mystic Oni"
		"Spirit Boar"
		"Spirit Bird"
		"Spirit Beast"
		"True Dragonewt"
		""
		"&eHoly&r is a status that is signified by the yellow race name in your stats menu"
		"cant breath underwater and your food bar wont go lower than 18"
		""
		"&eHoly&r Race is just a tag for race that gives you &eHoly&r status upon reaching your third evolution"
		""
		"&eHoly&r Race Tag will lock away becoming a &5True Demon Lord&r unless you are Chaos-aligned, via you or another player who has the unique skill Reverser"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&n&l&5Majin&r&r&r"
		"A catchall term for intelligent Monsters. They can be born naturally, be the result of monsters that have undergone mutation, or evolved from already intelligent non-magical beings that have undergone monsterization."
		""
		"- Can I still get &eHero&r Egg despite becoming a &5Majin&r?"
		"YES However it depends on how you became a &5Majin&r. "
		""
		"If you became a &5Majin&r through methods listed below (Except Spawning as a &5Majin&r) You can still obtain the &eHero&r Egg. "
		""
		"If you became &5Majin&r through Race Evolution I.e Kijin -> Wicked Oni, You can no longer obtain the Egg or Awaken to True Hero, unless you evolved back into a race that doesn't have the majin race tag."
		""
		"&2&l&nObtaining&r&r&r"
		"&5Majin&r can be acquired in 4 main ways"
		""
		"-Use a Marionette Heart"
		"- Die to Magicule Poisoning (have more Magicules than your Max) (1%)"
		""
		"- Die to Demon Lord Haki (5%)"
		""
		"- Start as a &5Majin&r Race - Slime · Ghoul · Wight · Lesser Daemon · Harpy · Giant"
		""
		"- It can also be acquired by some race evolutions. (Vampire (From Human), Wicked Oni, Orc Lord)"
		""
		"&5Majin&r is a status that is signified by the purple race name in your stats menu"
		"no longer need to breath underwater and your food bar wont go lower than 18"
		""
		"- &5Majin&r Race is just a tag for race that gives you &5Majin&r status on acquiring the race"
		""
		"- &5Majin&r Race Tag will lock away becoming a &eTrue Hero&r unless you are Chaos-aligned, via you or another player who has the unique skill Reverser"
		""
		"- Acquiring &5Majin&r, rather than being one by default, will still allow you to acquire the &eHero&r Egg"
	]
	quest.5EF80BF205A9D291.title: "Alignment"
	quest.5F52DD4E21D33FEE.quest_desc: [
		"Hovering over Prestige/reset counter in your menu will tell you what quests you need to compleate before you can prestige"
		""
		"when all the quests are done use a character reset scroll to increase your reset counter. Each pristige will give you an addittinal unique skill"
		""
		"&4NOTE: resetting too early will remove a number from your counter&r"
		""
		"This is a gameruel thast not set automaticaly for info on the gaemrule go to next page"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&9&l&nUsage&r&r&r"
		""
		"- Flexing as the Reset Counter comes with a Rank/Medal system showing up in your Status Menu."
		""
		"- When the Gamerule &o&nresetCounterBonusUnique&r&r is higher than 0: Upon resetting, the player will gain bonus Unique Skills based on the amount of Reset Counter they have:"
		""
		"-If the value of the gamerule is 1, it will be 1 extra unique every single reset. (so you then get 2 uniques when you have reset)"
		""
		"-If the value of the gamerule is 5, it will be 1 extra unique every 5 resets (e.g. 2 bonus uniques at 10 resets)"
	]
	quest.5FAA199278D1196B.quest_desc: [
		"Transmog allows you to change the appearance of items without modifying their behavior at all!"
		"It works on armor, weapons, tools and anything else you can imagine!"
	]
	quest.5FCCD3FBAB7A1966.quest_desc: ["Modded servers can sometimes encounter an issue where dropped items do not despawn after 5 minutes. This results in unnecessary server lag due to entities. This simple mod aims to fix that by clearing dropped items every 10 minutes. This can be useful in a heavily modded environment where lots of players have dropped unwanted items on the ground that have not despawned and cause users to suffer entity lag. A warning message is displayed 10 minutes and 1 minute prior to clearing ground items. "]
	quest.6001AADC6A5656DE.quest_desc: ["...hmm"]
