		"the forge comes in 3 tiers and is a made as a multiblock smelter. how you make it can be shown on the next page"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"bottom going up, X = block, 0 = air, 1 = forge"
		""
		"xxx   0x0   0x0"
		"xxx   x0x   x0x"
		"xxx   010   0x0"
		""
		"the air spaces can be blocks as long as the middle is empty"
	]
