	quest.68D909A9123613F2.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to: Forbidden and Arcanus."
		"Full of magical content, and beautiful textures!"
		""
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Click For Wiki\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"bold\":true,\"underlined\":false,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://wiki.valhelsia.net/external-mods/forbidden-and-arcanus/wiki\"}}]"
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"FEATURES:"
		"- Create various rituals in Hephaestus Forge, and upgrade the tier of your Hephaestus Forge."
		"- Upgrade your weapons and tools to get stronger than ever before!"
		"- New items and trinkets with unique characteristics."
		"- Smelt ores in the Clibano and have a chance to double your ingots with the help of souls."
		"- Investigate all the secrets in the new research system, and unlock all the Forbiddenomicon content!"
	]
	quest.692BC44C7B9AF3B4.quest_desc: [
		"This simple and basic mod allows you to zoom in on an area using a command. This works server-side as well so you don't need this installed on the client. Simply use the trigger command &l/trigger darkzoom&r and you will enter a zoomed mode which will show you a zoomed view of what you are seeing. This effect lasts for 2 seconds and can be reactivated again."
		""
		"Note: This makes use of the in-game FOV function. Make sure your FOV slider is at 100% for this to work correctly."
	]
	quest.694372C448477D6F.quest_desc: [
		"Dropped by The Wither"
		""
		"Has witnessed destruction. Maybe it also witnessed your stuff disappear"
	]
	quest.6944ED782E2947B0.quest_desc: ["The Overworld is the primary dimension in Minecraft. It has a wide variety of unique biomes to explore, and is easily the most diverse of the dimensions. Players will typically spend most of their time in this dimension."]
	quest.694B62520750117F.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to Amethyst Imbuement, a mod all about the innate magic within crystals, gems, and you!"
		""
		"Use your experience as a resource to transmute various crystals and materials, infuse equipment with magical abilities, craft powerful new items, and more."
		""
		"This will only cover the basics, use the book and JEI for more detail"
	]
	quest.694B62520750117F.quest_subtitle: "The book will help you"
	quest.699A61FB1C8A3FD0.title: "Bronze - Silver"
	quest.69A229A187945ACB.quest_desc: ["when in water get water breathing and nitght vission effects"]
	quest.69FE9398DA156ED5.quest_subtitle: "Costs 5 bronze"
	quest.69FE9398DA156ED5.title: "Training Dummy"
	quest.6A0237FADC519965.quest_desc: ["From a distance, it looks peaceful. Fields of golden wheat swaying beside a proud windmill. But don’t be deceived: the Illagers tend no crops for trade. Behind the rustic facade lies a nest of evil, their blades as sharp as the sickles they carry."]
	quest.6A0237FADC519965.quest_subtitle: "Find an Illager Windmill"
	quest.6A3B78E8FD87AC28.quest_desc: ["Kill mobs with a gem of promise in off hand"]
	quest.6A5F13874917773C.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.6A7EDF1F8C14AD98.title: "Apple"
	quest.6ACED13B32258CB6.title: "Trickster Armor"
	quest.6B1A006667739D72.quest_desc: ["Don't want to go looking for smithing templates? or in a hurry to trim a particular piece of armor? then just craft the templates with ease. Use custom recipes to craft different smithing templates and then duplicate them for further smithing. Use EMI/JEI to view the recipes for the smithing templates."]
	quest.6B24B62A8CFD1A73.quest_desc: ["Obtain Hearthflame and cause tremors that pull enemies toward you"]
	quest.6B813CB8C2E8083A.quest_desc: ["Generates under Icy bioms between Y=-64 and Y=32 (mostly Y=-16)"]
	quest.6B9737DEBE668688.quest_desc: ["Kill The Returning Knight"]
	quest.6BA11DC961F93191.quest_desc: ["Generates in Nether Fortresses with a 10% chance"]
	quest.6BB62852215E0869.quest_desc: ["+3 armor"]
	quest.6BFE5D35265080E6.quest_desc: ["A sprawling underground stronghold, the Scorched Mines radiate in four cardinal directions from a central dome. Heat and shadows fill the tunnels, and danger lurks at every turn. Brave adventurers who navigate its branching paths may uncover riches, but only if they survive the hazards within."]
	quest.6BFE5D35265080E6.quest_subtitle: "Find the Scorched Mines"
	quest.6C7D975372A668F7.quest_desc: ["Generates in End Citys with a 10% chance"]
	quest.6CB5ACBAAED66871.quest_desc: ["Shaped from the stem and cap of a giant fungus, this whimsical dwelling offers a rare touch of charm in a perilous world. Lightly guarded and easy to claim, the mushroom house makes for a delightful refuge, perfect for any adventurer who’s ever dreamed of calling a mushroom home."]
	quest.6CB5ACBAAED66871.quest_subtitle: "Find a Mushroom House"
	quest.6D73DAFDA959344E.title: "Sign language"
	quest.6D98DAAF2AC19AF9.quest_desc: [
		"Images can be taken by right-clicking a camera. This brings you to the viewfinder of the camera. Right-clicking again takes an image of the perspective you are currently seeing. Images are saved with the same ratio as your Minecraft window."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The camera is able to apply filters to the image. By sneak + right-clicking the camera a GUI opens where the filter can be chosen."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You can zoom in and out by scrolling."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You can either look at the image by right-clicking the image item or by putting it in an image frame."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The album can hold up to 54 images. You can add images by sneak + right-clicking the album. You can view the contained images by right-clicking the album. By scrolling up and down or pressing the arrow-up/down key, you can switch the currently viewed image."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The image frame allows you to place your image in the world. Just place the image frame item on a wall. Sneak + right-clicking the image frame opens a GUI that allows you to resize the frame. Just clicking the resize buttons enlarges the frame in the given direction. If you sneak and click the button the frame will be downsize the frame in that direction. To display an image in the frame right-click it with the chosen image in hand. To remove it from the frame just right-click the frame again."
	]
	quest.6E0CCA66D810E74C.title: "Gold - Silver"
	quest.6E1152043FB0BFF3.quest_desc: [
		"A ritual magic system centered around summonable spirits allows you to automate various tasks, store vast amounts of items, let demons mine in void dimensions, create powerful enchanted tools and jewelry, get support from familiars, and much much more."
		""
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Click For Wiki\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"bold\":true,\"underlined\":false,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://minecraftoccultism.fandom.com/wiki/Minecraft-occultism\"}}]"
	]
	quest.6F1D88B5700EE8C2.quest_desc: ["Craft the Altar of Inspiration and fill it with blood to level up"]
	quest.6F4CE806F9952FFD.quest_desc: ["Obtain Whisperwind and dash forward with the grace of the breeze"]
	quest.6F5E0B800DC75B89.title: "Geckotoa"
	quest.6F928846C829728B.quest_desc: ["If near a hostile mob grants speed"]
	quest.6FA4DE410B2DE6BF.quest_subtitle: "Raw Etheruim is found in end city chests"
	quest.70327C3AC547B354.quest_desc: ["Marked by its dark prismarine and yellow terracotta roof, this temple has long since fallen to corruption. Inside, swarms of spider-like creatures creep through its halls, striking with venom and ferocity. To enter is to step into a nest where every shadow crawls."]
	quest.70327C3AC547B354.quest_subtitle: "Find an Infested Temple"
	quest.7052C9A5A804E866.quest_desc: ["A riot of color rises from the wilderness, marking the territory of a cunning band of raiders. Their homes are bright and inviting, but enter at your own risk. These defenders strike fast and often. Those who prevail will find spoils and secrets hidden among the lively façades."]
	quest.7052C9A5A804E866.quest_subtitle: "Find a Bandit Village"
	quest.7057BEF95530BB17.quest_desc: ["Keep upgrading the Midas sword with midas gold for it to grow in power (this will take a LOT of midas gold and time)"]
	quest.707FFBD10638FF18.quest_desc: ["Most of the hostile mobs will have special effects on them to make them difficult to kill."]
	quest.7084F0F662A9EA97.quest_desc: [
		"Advent of Ascension is all about modern adventure and exploration gameplay designed to expand and extend during and beyond vanilla, catering to all playstyles."
		""
		"Adds new content to the Overworld and the Nether, and new dimensions beyond!"
		""
