	quest.7A2B6934909E5BE0.quest_desc: [
		"We have Golden Apples in the game, but now we can have Golden Feathers! Simply craft a Golden Feather like you would craft a golden apple but this time use feathers. Consuming the Golden Feather will give you Slow Falling, Absorption, and Haste effects for 10 minutes. This is great for jumping off cliffs or mining! "
		""
