	quest.7B7FA476AB6352BD.quest_desc: [
		"No Griefing or stealing from others. If found griefing your character will be banned for 20 days. Extreme griefing or exploiting the game in anyway will get banned forever. "
		""
		"PvP must be consented by all players involved, this includes skill use"
		""
		"no using skills that can copy other skills on other players without consent, and no naming any player without consent (and keep the names appropriate)"
		""
		"No Spamming or flooding chat (only talking in full caps also counts, you dont need to shout we can hear you well enough)"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"No Advertising"
		""
		"No Cursing/No Constant Cursing"
		""
		"No Trolling/Flaming"
		""
		"No Banned Items (they will be removed automatically upon pick up, and there recipes are disabled so no worries)"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"No Asking for OP"
		""
		"Respect all Players and staff"
		""
		"Obey Staff Members"
		""
		"No Racist/Sexist/homophobic or other discrimitory Remarks"
		""
		"No Hacks, scripts or macros. if they give you an unfair advantage its not allowed"
		""
		"No Builds Near Spawn"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"No 1x1 Towers"
		""
		"No malicious targeting of anybody's physical, mental or social conditions verbally or textually."
		""
		"No inappropriate usernames or skins"
		""
		"Any Player, Item, Farm, Claimed Chunk, found to be a cause of severe server lag may be removed by a server admin at their discretion."
		""
		"Please do not try starting cults or religions in the server (dont ask ;-;)"
		""
		"Do Not impersonating a staff member, be it using their skin or pretending to be them"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"no blocking/ breaking or moving lootr chests, there for everyone (if there in the way ask a staff member to move it)"
	]
